{"id":"kendall_tau","title":"EchoTime reference: Kendall tau-b","family":"native","definition":"echotime","intro_en":"The native Kendall reference uses tau-b, including corrections for one-sided ties, on the resampled input grid. It counts ordering agreements and disagreements rather than amplitude gaps. The animation reconstructs its pair classifications and normalization. This explanatory enumeration matches the score while leaving the numerical library free to use a more efficient algorithm internally.","intro_zh":"原生 Kendall 参照在重采样网格上使用包含单侧并列校正的 tau-b，统计顺序同向与反向关系，不比较幅值差。动画重建配对分类和归一化；这种教学枚举与实际分数一致，数值库内部可以使用更高效算法。","steps_en":["Use the native report's resampled observations.","Compare relative orders for observation pairs.","Count concordance, discordance and one-sided ties.","Apply tau-b normalization and keep its sign."],"steps_zh":["使用原生报告重采样后的观测。","比较观测对的相对顺序。","统计同序、逆序和单侧并列。","应用 tau-b 归一化并保留符号。"],"formula":"(C-D)/sqrt((C+D+T_x)*(C+D+T_y)) on resampled observations","caveats_en":["EchoTime assigns zero for constant inputs; statistical correlation is undefined in that case.","These are dependence summaries, not causal tests or identity probabilities.","The illustrative report explicitly uses n_points=24; the default is 256."],"caveats_zh":["EchoTime 对常量输入赋零；此时统计相关本身未定义。","这些是依赖关系摘要，不是因果检验或同一性概率。","演示报告显式使用 n_points=24，默认值为 256。"],"sources":[{"label":"EchoTime comparison implementation","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/similarity.py"},{"label":"SciPy: kendalltau","url":"https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.stats.kendalltau.html"}],"x":[0.0,0.3,0.9,1.8,2.7,2.1,1.5,1.1,1.3,2.0,2.8,3.4,3.0,2.4,2.1,2.5,3.4,4.2,4.4,4.0,3.7,3.9,4.8,5.2],"y":[1.5,2.0519225760215023,2.5029737413368567,2.8847890070498634,3.3269392741386694,2.933060886050363,2.8090394772296827,2.72585888185695,2.7447210175121164,2.9398624371786375,3.3900034277072537,4.0626233874128905,4.107225730147529,3.7653701874961145,3.286091424860995,3.25087